  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "t25_c",
      "defType": "meta/comment",
      "position": {
        "x": -644,
        "y": 0
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "Spring physics with state\n\nA position chases the mouse with Hooke + damping. Two state slots (vec2): position and velocity. Each frame:\n  • a = (mouse − pos) · k − vel · damp\n  • vel ← vel + a\n  • pos ← pos + vel\n\nWrite/Read are used twice — one for pos, one for vel.",
        "width": 440,
        "height": 240
      },
      "portValues": {
        "text": "Spring physics with state\n\nA position chases the mouse with Hooke + damping. Two state slots (vec2): position and velocity. Each frame:\n  • a = (mouse − pos) · k − vel · damp\n  • vel ← vel + a\n  • pos ← pos + vel\n\nWrite/Read are used twice — one for pos, one for vel.",
        "width": 440,
        "height": 240
      }
    },
